Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A souvenir?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we went to\Na hot spring the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Please enjoy it with\Nthe others at your agency!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:14.28,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}STRAWBERRY - PLAIN\NCHOCOLATE - GREEN TEA\N- Hot springs pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Which should I take?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you managed to get\Na hot springs date out of your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-The work came first, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you had to\Nreschedule things here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, we did manage\Nto solve the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kikira, you don't\Nwant one? Maybe later?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He likes green tea flavor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We just got here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it took me longer\Nthan I expected to get out...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira-san said you were having\Ntrouble collecting evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah... That's what\Nhad me late again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to find\Nevidence in all this garbage?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry. I didn't realize it would be\Nso much either...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.36,0:02:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I really need evidence\Nfor this case, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:03:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry it's all so sudden. I can ask\Nanother agency if you need me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't say I wouldn't do it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When do you need it by?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, well...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have a meeting\Nwith the client in two days...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a rush job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm really sorry!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Daichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You found the evidence in\Nthat garbage heap this quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.72,0:03:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. You're\Ngonna pick up the stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell in love all over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikira-san's amazing, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's serious about that stuff, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell Daichi\NI was gushing about him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a lucky guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe a sourpuss like him found\Na partner who really gets him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.01,0:03:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jarashi-san, you haven't\Nmet someone who gets you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this now?\NYou have someone you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.63,0:04:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that. We're just\Nkind of on the same wavelength...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes it easy to be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the one from the clothing shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah! That clerk I told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had a ton of fun\Nchoosing outfits since we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's important to have\Nsomeone like that in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When you have an interest in common,\Nyou can talk about anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jarashi-san, you've been acting different\Nsince the two of you met.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes. You've been so calm and peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess life does get easier\Nwhen you've got less on your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, how are things\Nfor you in that area lately, Shizuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you and Tonome\Nare still getting along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're currently planning\Nour cohabitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you, making it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:07.03,Main - Top,,0,0,0,,And soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.03,0:05:11.49,Default,Sign Overlap,0,0,0,,{\an8}CELEBRATE!! AKIRA-SAN'S FIRST SLEEPOVER!\N- Akira-san will be staying\Nat my place for the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Romance has refined your cuteness\Nto even more powerful levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You gush even more than I do, I think!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys get along so well.\NI guess you don't even fight at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, most people\Nfight with their SOs,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.32,0:05:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but I haven't heard\Nof you fighting even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I did complain about\Nhim being an SD once...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,An SD?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.31,0:05:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He was being too considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But Tonome's a born gentleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,so even something like\Nthat wouldn't turn into a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:05:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- True!\N- I suppose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello.\N- Welcome, Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I smell roses?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I bought them on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so looking forward to staying\Nat your place, I couldn't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.94,0:06:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be with Akira-san\Nall night in my apartment!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to make him feel at home!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.27,0:06:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit early for dinner, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I suppose so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.07,0:06:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so excited. Maybe I came too early?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... How about a nice cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I buy some tea\Nsnacks while I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.52,0:06:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.80,0:06:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's a chocolate cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You made that yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... it wasn't that hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had a partner\Nmake sweet things for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's not that impressive...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- It makes me so happy!\N- Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I have whipped cream\Nto go with the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait just a minute!\N- Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.51,0:07:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the cream right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make the tea too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a vase or a glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking I'd put the roses in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a glass—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold very still.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.73,0:07:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to get\Ncream on your outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I can lick it off myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's all over your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- N-No.\N- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Akira-san's hands are so kind!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My heart can't take it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she upset?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any whipping\Ncream left in your fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.87,0:08:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- Would you like to remake it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There, all clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's delicious.\N- Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes well with\Nthe black tea, too. I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What could be better than this?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.01,0:09:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To think this happiness\Ncould continue all night...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira-san. You're quite stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I insist that I sleep on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.28,0:09:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot allow you to sleep on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely step on you\Nwhen I have to get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about that! I {\i1}prefer{\i0} it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.29,0:09:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll act as a footstool\Nwhen you're getting out of bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to wake you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at an impasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't we both\Nsleep on the floor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should we do that? We could\Njust sleep in the bed together...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.31,0:10:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it too cramped for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Akira-san's in my bed!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And two people\Nin a single is definitely...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I sleep on the other side\Nso that you don't fall out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No! That's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come close to me, then. You'll fall out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We slept together at the inn, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Having you so close in my usual bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,i-it's like I'm doing something naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're cute when you're naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.07,0:11:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I made coffee. Would you like one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was too nervous to get much sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had to go to the bathroom too...\NI'm so glad I slept on the outside.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.79,0:11:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we pay a visit to your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking it might be time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.20,0:11:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we getting married now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but I thought we should let\Nthem know we'll be living together...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Of course. Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I jumped to conclusions again!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it when you get your hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me appreciate how cute you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You shouldn't love that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, I'm going to call my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Let's set up a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- So, you know...\N{\i1}- Yes?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.59,0:12:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Akira-san\Nand I move in together...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,can we pay you a visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! Your father\Nand Fu-kun will be here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.33,0:12:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Great! See you then!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- What was that about?\N- Oh, Fu-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that big sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she's coming to visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- At last, this day is finally here!\N- What day?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's bringing a boyfriend home!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to stand face-to-face\Nand get his measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that, now! He's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Tonome-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello, Fu-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fu-kun's here too? It's been so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira-san, Fu-kun's my little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.85,0:13:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No face, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I do actually have one...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Being in the old family\Ncar is so relaxing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you two ever go out for drives?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's really staring at me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, is Fu-kun a nickname?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Futa. I'm in my second year of high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not often meet invisible people?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.16,0:13:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And why do you have that bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- No need to worry about that. Yet.\N- "Yet"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be there soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.72,0:14:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My, this is the house you grew up in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The mosaic art tiling is beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fu-kun and I made that a long time ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me know\Nthe entrance step is just ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not so uneven\Nthat it could trip you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.69,0:14:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They made it as a summer\Nhandicrafts project.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. With Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like a wonderful memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to hear more like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get an album, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have plenty of time\Nfor that later, so let's save it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, shall we go to my room first?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, let's.\N- I'm coming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay with you, right, Tonome-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're so pushy, Fu-kun.\N- Is it a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.15,0:14:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Fu-kun! Take them drinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san. Let me\Nhelp you up the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.16,0:15:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my own house.\NI know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.27,0:15:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then I'll stick right behind you.\N- You'd better!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.67,0:15:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so beautifully minimalist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I take your coat?\NI can put it on a hanger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Akira-san is in my childhood\Nhome! It feels so strange!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's really staring at me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Futa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any questions for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seemed rather interested in me...\NWhy's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, every time I look at you,\Nwe make eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've been staring at me,\Nso I thought you had a question...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I didn't\Nnotice you staring?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... how could I make eye contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where your face\Nor your eyes are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,True, I am invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can look wherever you want all\Nthe time! That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're the one looking at {\i1}him{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it is handy\Nwhen you're a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka's boyfriend is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my dad's home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, would you like\Nto say hello to him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But he only just got back, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When do you think we should go down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.59,0:16:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, should they come down now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We've ordered takeout,\Nso we'll call them down when it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.68,0:16:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The sushi is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Akira Tonome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.89,0:17:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.99,0:17:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, eat as much as you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's eat!\N- Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.13,0:17:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put your favorites\Nin front of you, Shizuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He seems a lot like Futa-kun.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- You drink?\N- Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.09,0:17:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the owner\Nof Shizuka's workplace, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Though it's a very small agency...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.91,0:17:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'll try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.98,0:17:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is awkward.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And he's staring at me\Nas intensely as Futa-kun did.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do I do? I hope I didn't\Nsay something to offend him...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you handle whiskey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! He's a hard man to read!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been looking\Nforward to sharing a drink
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.80,0:18:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,with his daughter's\Nspecial someone for ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight, on the rocks, or diluted?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocks, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to see my daughter as a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made a compilation of her\Npictures and videos I can run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, I'd love that!\N- Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food. I'm taking a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis, get ready to take\Nyour bath and sleep, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right!\N- Tonome-san, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband's family memorial\Nvideo is five hours long!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:18:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's quite impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the hospital\Nwhere my daughter was born...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't want anyone\Nbut her mother in those hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to turn a day trip\Ninto an overnight stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop my husband\Nwhen he gets his movie rolling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Will you leave after breakfast?\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drive you to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! There's a delicious\Nbakery on the way back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can buy yourselves some lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.59,0:19:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What bakery is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's new! You can get—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.87,0:19:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san and I have been\Ndating for some time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:20:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're hoping to move\Nin together soon, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right! We came here\Nto tell them that!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we're fine with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right, dear?\N- Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.93,0:20:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, did you already know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I told him that's\Nwhy you were coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she was\Njust introducing him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.84,0:20:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I? I did tell your father...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.38,0:20:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, now that we're\Non the same page...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope to continue our acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We feel the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No one told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been home in so long,\NI fell back into old routines...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.73,0:20:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was so hard to find\Nthe right moment to say it, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But they're totally on board\Nwith it! Isn't that nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.22,0:21:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't think I've ever heard\NAkira-san so nervous before!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.00,0:21:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I think I should\Nintroduce you to my pare—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you all right? Was it too hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.55,0:21:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot. But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to meet his parents,\Ntoo! Of course I do!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.69,0:21:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd already met your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.01,0:21:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,which made things a bit more comfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but you haven't met my\Nparents even once, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How should we approach it?\NShould we put it off longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I definitely want to meet them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was raised in a city\Nwith a lot of diverse species,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but my parents since\Nmoved back to our hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.81,0:21:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rather far, so we\Nmay have to stay over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.47,0:21:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that all right?\N- Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.13,0:21:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a rather particular place, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.12,0:22:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the invisible person village.\NOnly our kind live there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The invisible person... village?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:10.01,Default,Sign Overlap,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 10: BEFORE WE MOVE IN TOGETHER\NTO BE CONTINUED
